          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.advancedthaumaturgy.tut_addon_advancedthaumaturgy.text.1",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "高等神秘学是什么\n",
                  "bold": true
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "advancedthaumaturgy:tut_addon_advancedthaumaturgy/text/2",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.advancedthaumaturgy.tut_addon_advancedthaumaturgy.text.2",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "它的核心是一根可以"
                },
                {
                  "text": "插入水晶升级",
                  "bold": true
                },
                {
                  "text": "的水银法杖：在魔杖台上安装充能、倍增吸取、节能等升级。此外还有节点修改器（改变节点类型和要素）、把源质转化为电能的源质引擎，以及提供范围效果的「微晶器」哨兵。\n"
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "advancedthaumaturgy:tut_addon_advancedthaumaturgy/divider/3",
          "type": "DIVIDER"
        },
        {
          "id": "advancedthaumaturgy:tut_addon_advancedthaumaturgy/text/4",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.advancedthaumaturgy.tut_addon_advancedthaumaturgy.text.4",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "从哪里开始\n",
                  "bold": true
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "advancedthaumaturgy:tut_addon_advancedthaumaturgy/text/5",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.advancedthaumaturgy.tut_addon_advancedthaumaturgy.text.5",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "advancedthaumaturgy:MERCURIALROD"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：水银杖芯，需要银树杖柄和注魔。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "advancedthaumaturgy:MERCURIALWAND"
                },
                {
                  "text": "、"
                },
                {
                  "research": "advancedthaumaturgy:WANDBENCH"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：水银水晶法杖与魔杖台。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "advancedthaumaturgy:NODEMODIFIER"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：节点修改器。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "advancedthaumaturgy:ESSENTIAENGINE"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：源质引擎。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "advancedthaumaturgy:MINILITHBASE"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：微晶器基座。\n部分哨兵在原作中未完成，研究页会注明。\n"
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
